A macro call naming a path with no declaration fails with exit 2 and a stderr
message naming the path.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "x={{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}"
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value "{{ macro('core.macros.nope') }}": no macro declared at config path: core.macros.nope
